      "english": "And he lost consciousness for a short space of time.",
      "source": "Encomium on Victor part 1",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:pscelestinus.encomium.budge:1-31",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲇⲉ ⲡⲁⲓ**ⲣⲏϯ** ⲛⲁⲥⲟⲓ ⲛϩⲩⲥⲟⲥ ⲁⲛ ⲛϫⲉⲧⲟⲩⲙⲉⲧⲙⲉⲑⲣⲉ .",
      "english": "Even so, their testimony did not agree.",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 14 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:14",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲙⲁⲗⲓⲥⲧⲁ ⲡϣⲱⲛⲉ ⲉⲧⲡⲟⲣϣ ⲉⲃⲟⲗ ⲉϫⲛⲛⲁⲟⲩ**ⲣⲏⲧⲉ** ⲕⲁⲧⲁⲕⲁⲓⲣⲟⲥ · ⲁⲕⲧⲣⲉϥⲁⲥⲁⲓ ϩⲓϫⲱⲓ ϩⲓⲧⲛⲛⲉⲕⲡⲣⲉⲥⲃⲉⲓⲁ ⲉⲧⲟⲩⲁⲁⲃ ·",
      "english": "and especially because through thy holy gift the disease which spreadeth over my legs and feet from time to time thou hast made to decrease in my body.",
      "source": "Encomium on Victor part 3",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:pscelestinus.encomium.budge:56-103",
      "dialect": "sahidic"
    },
    {
      "coptic": "ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲁϥϣⲱⲡⲓ ⲉϥⲉⲣⲁⲅⲁⲡⲁⲛ ⲙⲙⲟϥ ⲙⲫ**ⲣⲏϯ** ⲛⲟⲩⲁⲅⲅⲉⲗⲟⲥ ⲛⲧⲉⲫⲛⲟⲩϯ .",
      "english": "And he cherished him like an angel of God.",
      "source": "Life of Isaac of Alexandria - part 2",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:lives.boh_isaac.amelineau_ed:20-41",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
